{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/f437930e2a6fb93f34197be58d84ca2f.avif?t=1758271782\" data-has-big width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heroes Have Arrived,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to face bold heroes from across the multiverse?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With supply lines severed by the Senate, it\u2019s up to you, the Demon Lord, to rebuild your power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully construct rooms to maximize synergy and generate essential resources to strengthen your castle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/1ea6c841f315c6fdbf9af8242c018513.avif?t=1758271782\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place rooms and traps to exploit their unique effects. Each room serves a distinct purpose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Potion Shop: Sell curious elixirs to heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Hot Springs: Offer \u201crelaxation\u201d with a twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Coliseum: Invite heroes to battle for a price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Mimic Mushroom Chest: Might reward or punch them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine these with lairs for adorable monsters to unlock advanced effects: headache-inducing potions, armor-melting slime baths, and more! Countless room combos await your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/3d4802ec894f77e85059d919f8dbf49d.poster.avif?t=1758271782\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/3d4802ec894f77e85059d919f8dbf49d.webm?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/3d4802ec894f77e85059d919f8dbf49d.mp4?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(In-development)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/3de988d9e2132a2bfdbbdc82fc8aabbf.avif?t=1758271782\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat invading heroes and convince them to join your cause! Capture them in battle, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then tempt them with sweet cream cake from your castle kitchen to earn their trust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014and maybe even their loyalty!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/2080e2b387e2d4f5c42bf7768c9a7ec9.poster.avif?t=1758271782\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/2080e2b387e2d4f5c42bf7768c9a7ec9.webm?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/2080e2b387e2d4f5c42bf7768c9a7ec9.mp4?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(In-development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/117c76d74f09e0bff62b8fc45be75219.poster.avif?t=1758271782\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/117c76d74f09e0bff62b8fc45be75219.webm?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/117c76d74f09e0bff62b8fc45be75219.mp4?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(In-development)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/2b7aabb8dbce359bff2b6142c2aa43e7.avif?t=1758271782\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a relaxed but strategic gameplay loop which reduces grind and power creep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The default difficulty focuses on tension, not punishing failure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you lose a battle, you\u2019ll still earn progress-matching rewards, growing steadily and avoiding frustration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/c7ebede0deaea39c0403d7d0e1203326.poster.avif?t=1758271782\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/c7ebede0deaea39c0403d7d0e1203326.webm?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/c7ebede0deaea39c0403d7d0e1203326.mp4?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(In-development)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/ba3f2513a727060cfc78cd00e1a1d06a.avif?t=1758271782\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced heroes and narration \u2014 hear their whispers in your ear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All character side stories, main plotlines, and map events feature immersive voice acting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices are recorded using the <u>KU100</u> dummy head mic (popular in ASMR), </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bringing a spatial, layered audio experience during key scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/c29dfcb1a4ca0bf686cd398b901b8b72.poster.avif?t=1758271782\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/c29dfcb1a4ca0bf686cd398b901b8b72.webm?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/c29dfcb1a4ca0bf686cd398b901b8b72.mp4?t=1758271782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(In-development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/extras/e85051c7dcde8780143beca10d28db89.avif?t=1758271782\" width=1110 height=4956 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357950?t=1758271782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/aa3e81ceb119a87bca0eea63af351d92815d3150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758271782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357950/4038b1d0efdf03d47d60ce6ea0450c7f0d2e01ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758271782","cap